{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-09-27 08:15:00', 'title': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL ANNOUNCES TRANSACTION TO ACQUIRE THE OPERATIONS OF THE COSMOPOLITAN OF LAS VEGAS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, SEPT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (THE "COMPANY" OR "MGM RESORTS") (NYSE: MGM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT WITH BLACKSTONE TO ACQUIRE THE OPERATIONS OF THE COSMOPOLITAN OF LAS VEGAS (THE "PROPERTY" OR "THE COSMOPOLITAN") FOR CASH CONSIDERATION OF $1.625 BILLION, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY WORKING CAPITAL ADJUSTMENTS.'}